  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>The bullet shatters the radius, one of the long bones in the forearm, causing a nasty-looking open fracture with shards of bone poking through the skin.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (2). You suffer a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.rlDZZTj5PXjuRXa2]{Broken Bone (Major)}. Also, the open fracture requires you to pass a <strong>Challenging (+0) Endurance</strong> Test or gain a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.kKccDTGzWzSXCBOb]{Festering Wound}. </p><p><strong>Surgery (Challenging)</strong> is required for Extraction of the many bone fragments even if the bullet didn’t lodge.</p>"
    },
